# ============================================
# Crit-Fumble Website (www) Environment Variables
# ============================================
# Copy this file to .env.local for development.
#
# This site is a static export: plain files, no server and no secrets. Its one
# runtime call is the host-status read in src/app/host-status.ts.

# Optional — point the status list at another copy of the status service.
# Inlined at BUILD time (NEXT_PUBLIC_*). Defaults to https://status.critfumble.com/.
# NEXT_PUBLIC_STATUS_URL=""
